title: DNSSEC status
agents: dnssec_health
catalog: app/dnssec_health
license: GPLv2
distribution:
description:
 This check reports the DNSSEC status of a domain, collected by the
 {dnssec_health} special agent. It determines whether the domain is signed
 (presence of DNSKEY records) and whether the configured recursive resolver
 validated the signatures (the AD bit in the response). The "validated" result
 therefore depends on the Checkmk server using a validating resolver.

 The plugin works on any domain, not only mail domains.

 States are configurable via the rule "DNSSEC status".

item:
 The domain name.

discovery:
 One service is created for each configured domain.
